    {
      "description": "Electric field instrument (EFI) Langmuir probe (LP) measurements at 2Hz",
      "descriptionType": "SeriesInformation"
    },
    {
      "description": "The EFIx_LP_1B Product contains plasma data from the Langmuir Probe (LP) of the Electrical Field Instrument (EFI). The plasma product encompasses the plasma density and temperature. Data is provided at 2 Hz rate. The time instant are determined by the EFI instruments. No interpolation of the EFI data is performed, neither to shift the measurements in time nor to fill any gaps.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
